---
import SponsorLayout from '@/layouts/Sponsor.astro';

interface LegalSection {
  readonly id: string;
  readonly heading: string;
  readonly paragraphs: readonly string[];
  readonly bullets?: readonly string[];
}

const contactEmail: string = 'legal@thepabitrams.com';
const effectiveDateIso: string = '2026-10-18';
const effectiveDateLabel: string = 'October 18, 2026';
const lastUpdatedDateIso: string = '2026-10-18';
const lastUpdatedDateLabel: string = 'October 18, 2026';

const legalSections: readonly LegalSection[] = [
  {
    id: 'acceptance',
    heading: '1. Acceptance of These Terms',
    paragraphs: [
      'These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of the sponsorship pages, sponsorship links, and related content made available on this website (collectively, the "Sponsorship Program"). The Sponsorship Program is operated by the individual developer identified on this website ("Operator", "I", "me", or "my").',
      'By accessing the Sponsorship Program, initiating a sponsorship, or continuing to use this website, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree with any part of these Terms, you must not initiate or continue a sponsorship.',
      'You represent and warrant that you are at least the age of legal majority in your jurisdiction and have the legal capacity to enter into these Terms. If you are sponsoring on behalf of an organization, you represent that you have authority to bind that organization to these Terms.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'voluntary-sponsorship',
    heading: '2. Sponsorships Are Entirely Voluntary',
    paragraphs: [
      'All sponsorships are voluntary, discretionary, and gratuitous contributions made of your own free will. A sponsorship is a gift-like contribution intended to support the ongoing maintenance and development of open-source software and related educational content.',
      'You are under no obligation whatsoever to sponsor. No sponsorship is required to access, use, download, modify, or distribute any open-source project published by the Operator, and no sponsorship creates or implies any form of membership, partnership, employment, agency, joint venture, franchise, or fiduciary relationship between you and the Operator.',
      'Because sponsorships are voluntary contributions, they do not entitle you to any equity, ownership, governance rights, voting rights, or control over the Operator\'s projects, priorities, roadmap, or business decisions.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'no-goods-or-services',
    heading: '3. No Purchase of Goods or Services',
    paragraphs: [
      'A sponsorship does not constitute a purchase of goods, services, licenses, subscriptions, digital content, or any other commercial product. No consideration is exchanged for any deliverable, and no contract for the supply of goods or services is formed between you and the Operator by virtue of a sponsorship.',
      'Sponsorships are not donations to a registered charity, tax-exempt organization, or non-profit entity unless expressly stated otherwise. The Operator is an independent individual developer and does not represent that any sponsorship is tax-deductible in your jurisdiction. You are solely responsible for determining the tax treatment of any sponsorship you make.',
      'Any tangible or intangible benefit that may occasionally be offered to sponsors (such as a name listing, a badge, or a thank-you mention) is provided on a discretionary, courtesy basis, carries no independent monetary value, and does not convert a sponsorship into a commercial transaction.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'no-guaranteed-support',
    heading: '4. No Guaranteed Support, Service Levels, or Priority Response',
    paragraphs: [
      'Unless you and the Operator have entered into a separate, express, written agreement signed by the Operator that specifically provides otherwise, a sponsorship does NOT entitle you to any of the following:',
    ],
    bullets: [
      'Guaranteed technical support, troubleshooting, consulting, or implementation assistance of any kind.',
      'Priority, expedited, or guaranteed response times to issues, pull requests, emails, or messages.',
      'Service level agreements (SLAs), uptime commitments, bug-fix timelines, or release schedules.',
      'Custom development, feature requests, roadmap influence, or dedicated maintenance.',
      'Security audits, compliance attestations, warranties of fitness for a particular purpose, or professional advice.',
      'Any form of exclusivity, endorsement, sponsorship recognition beyond what is expressly published, or marketing placement.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'support-disclaimer',
    heading: '5. Support Is Provided at the Operator\'s Sole Discretion',
    paragraphs: [
      'Any support, communication, or engagement the Operator chooses to provide is rendered on a best-effort, voluntary, and discretionary basis, subject to availability, capacity, and interest. The Operator may decline, defer, or discontinue support for any requester at any time, for any reason, without liability.',
      'Acknowledgement of a sponsorship, a public thank-you, or general responsiveness in public issue trackers does not create an expectation, obligation, or enforceable right to continued or priority support.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'third-party-platforms',
    heading: '6. Third-Party Sponsorship Platforms',
    paragraphs: [
      'Sponsorship payments are processed exclusively through third-party platforms, including GitHub Sponsors (operated by GitHub, Inc.) and Buy Me a Coffee (operated by Buy Me a Coffee / Publisherr, Inc.), as linked from this website. The Operator does not process, store, or control payment card data.',
